{
  "format": "mosael-workflow",
  "version": 1,
  "workflow_revision": 1,
  "name": "Montage from your own footage",
  "description": "Pull a tagged batch of footage you already shot, let the model order the story, decide which part of which clip each beat uses, and write the narration; then lay every segment on the timeline in order, speak and caption each one (ducking the footage's own sound under the narration), and export. Nothing is generated — the picture is your own footage, and without a configured voice it falls back to captions only. If the tag is blank or has no videos, it stops and tells you. Up to 200 videos under the tag are used at a time; split larger batches with finer tags first.",
  "graph_hash": "53b14dbb78a95a3af76ba71effc5bd5ba72b6733094865c4d6c048519c6e02ee",
  "graph": {
    "meta": {
      "template_id": "footage_montage",
      "template_version": 2,
      "source": "official"
    },
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "start",
        "type": "start",
        "name": "Topic and footage tag",
        "position": {
          "x": 40,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "params": {
            "topic": "",
            "footage_tag": "",
            "audience": "潜在客户与合作方",
            "tone": "专业、克制、可信",
            "target_duration_seconds": 60,
            "voice_id": "",
            "width": 1920,
            "height": 1080,
            "fps": 30
          },
          "required_params": "topic, footage_tag"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "footage",
        "type": "asset_query",
        "name": "Fetch the footage by tag",
        "position": {
          "x": 330,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "kind": "video",
          "tags": "{{start.footage_tag}}",
          "limit": 200
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "has_footage",
        "type": "condition",
        "name": "Was any footage found?",
        "position": {
          "x": 650,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "left": "",
          "op": "gt",
          "right": "0"
        },
        "inputs": [
          "left"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "no_footage_notice",
        "type": "notify",
        "name": "No footage to cut",
        "position": {
          "x": 1290,
          "y": 520
        },
        "config": {
          "title": "混剪没有开始:没取到素材",
          "body": "标签「{{start.footage_tag}}」下没有视频素材。给要混剪的视频打上同一个标签,把这个标签填进开始节点的 footage_tag,再运行一次。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "montage_plan",
        "type": "llm",
        "name": "Order the story and write the narration",
        "position": {
          "x": 1290,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "profile_id": "",
          "model": "",
          "preset": "precise",
          "system": "你是企业宣传片的编导。用户会给你一批**已经拍好**的素材(每条有名字和时长)和一个主题，\n你要把它们排成一条讲得通的片子。\n\n硬性要求：\n- asset_id 必须**原样抄自素材清单**。不要改写、不要缩短、更不要编一个出来——抄错这一段就是空的。\n- 每一段从这条素材的 src_start 取到 src_end：src_end 不能超过那条素材的时长；seconds 就是 src_end − src_start。\n- 顺序要有叙事:开头给出观看理由,中段按因果或流程推进,结尾落到一个明确的信息或行动。\n  不要按素材的文件名顺序排。\n- narration 念出来不能超过这一段的 seconds:中文按每秒约 4 个字估，宁短勿长；\n  这一段不需要旁白就写空字符串。\n- captions 的时间码**相对这一段自己的开头**，不是成片时间。\n- 只描述素材里真的有的东西。不要编造产能、资质、检测结论、客户名称或任何数字——\n  没有依据的话一句都不要写。\n- 素材不够讲完这个主题时，宁可做短一点，并在 unused_note 里说明缺什么。\n\n只输出符合 JSON Schema 的对象。",
          "prompt": "这条片子要讲的事：{{start.topic}}\n目标观众：{{start.audience}}\n语气：{{start.tone}}\n成片目标时长：{{start.target_duration_seconds}} 秒\n\n可用素材清单（共 {{footage.count}} 条，含 id、名字与时长）：\n{{footage.assets}}\n\n请把它们排成一条讲得通的片子。再强调一次：asset_id 必须原样抄清单里的 id；\ncaptions 的时间码相对每一段自己的开头。",
          "response_format": "json_schema",
          "json_schema_name": "footage_montage_plan",
          "json_schema": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "storyline": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "整条片子的叙事线,一两句话"
              },
              "segments": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "type": "object",
                  "properties": {
                    "segment_title": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "这一段在讲什么,中文,给人看的"
                    },
                    "asset_id": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "用素材清单里的哪一条,**原样抄它的 id**,不要改写、不要编"
                    },
                    "source_name": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "那条素材的名字,抄一遍,方便人核对选得对不对"
                    },
                    "src_start": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": 0,
                      "description": "从这条素材的第几秒开始取"
                    },
                    "src_end": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": 0,
                      "description": "取到这条素材的第几秒为止;不能超过它的时长"
                    },
                    "seconds": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "minimum": 1.5,
                      "maximum": 20,
                      "description": "这一段在成片里多长,必须等于 src_end − src_start;旁白按它压"
                    },
                    "narration": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "这一段的口播原文,中文;念出来不超过本段时长,没有旁白就写空字符串"
                    },
                    "captions": {
                      "type": "array",
                      "items": {
                        "type": "object",
                        "properties": {
                          "start": {
                            "type": "number",
                            "minimum": 0,
                            "description": "相对本段开头的秒数"
                          },
                          "end": {
                            "type": "number",
                            "minimum": 0
                          },
                          "text": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "description": "这一句字幕,短句"
                          }
                        },
                        "required": [
                          "start",
                          "end",
                          "text"
                        ],
                        "additionalProperties": false
                      },
                      "minItems": 1
                    },
                    "why": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "description": "为什么这一段放在这个位置"
                    }
                  },
                  "required": [
                    "segment_title",
                    "asset_id",
                    "source_name",
                    "src_start",
                    "src_end",
                    "seconds",
                    "narration",
                    "captions",
                    "why"
                  ],
                  "additionalProperties": false
                },
                "minItems": 2,
                "maxItems": 24
              },
              "unused_note": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "哪些素材没用上、为什么;全用上了写空字符串"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "storyline",
              "segments",
              "unused_note"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          },
          "json_schema_strict": "true",
          "temperature": 0.4,
          "max_tokens": 16000
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "montage_project",
        "type": "project_sequence_create",
        "name": "Create the timeline",
        "position": {
          "x": 1290,
          "y": 460
        },
        "config": {
          "name": "{{start.topic}} · 混剪",
          "width": "{{start.width}}",
          "height": "{{start.height}}",
          "fps": "{{start.fps}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "lay_segments",
        "type": "loop_foreach",
        "name": "Lay every segment, with narration and captions",
        "position": {
          "x": 1610,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "items": "{{montage_plan.json.segments}}",
          "inputs": {
            "sequence_id": "{{montage_project.sequence_id}}",
            "video_track_id": "{{montage_project.video_track_id}}",
            "audio_track_id": "{{montage_project.audio_track_id}}",
            "voice_id": "{{start.voice_id}}"
          },
          "body": {
            "nodes": [
              {
                "id": "place_shot",
                "type": "timeline_append",
                "name": "Append this segment",
                "position": {
                  "x": 80,
                  "y": 140
                },
                "config": {
                  "sequence_id": "{{input.sequence_id}}",
                  "asset_id": "{{loop.item.asset_id}}",
                  "track_id": "{{input.video_track_id}}",
                  "start": "{{loop.item.src_start}}",
                  "end": "{{loop.item.src_end}}"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "has_voice",
                "type": "condition",
                "name": "Is a voice configured?",
                "position": {
                  "x": 400,
                  "y": 300
                },
                "config": {
                  "left": "{{input.voice_id}}",
                  "op": "not_empty"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "has_narration",
                "type": "condition",
                "name": "Does this segment have narration?",
                "position": {
                  "x": 720,
                  "y": 300
                },
                "config": {
                  "left": "{{loop.item.narration}}",
                  "op": "not_empty"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "narrate",
                "type": "synthesize_speech",
                "name": "Speak this segment's narration",
                "position": {
                  "x": 1040,
                  "y": 300
                },
                "config": {
                  "text": "{{loop.item.narration}}",
                  "engine": "builtin:clone",
                  "voice": "{{input.voice_id}}"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "place_voice",
                "type": "timeline_append",
                "name": "Align the narration to this segment's start",
                "position": {
                  "x": 1360,
                  "y": 300
                },
                "config": {
                  "sequence_id": "{{input.sequence_id}}",
                  "asset_id": "",
                  "track_id": "{{input.audio_track_id}}",
                  "at": "",
                  "max_duration": "",
                  "trim_overflow": "yes"
                },
                "inputs": [
                  "asset_id",
                  "at",
                  "max_duration"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "voice_overflow",
                "type": "condition",
                "name": "Was the narration cut short?",
                "position": {
                  "x": 1680,
                  "y": 480
                },
                "config": {
                  "left": "",
                  "op": "gt",
                  "right": "0"
                },
                "inputs": [
                  "left"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "overflow_notice",
                "type": "notify",
                "name": "Say the narration was cut",
                "position": {
                  "x": 2000,
                  "y": 480
                },
                "config": {
                  "title": "混剪:有一段旁白念不完",
                  "body": "「{{loop.item.segment_title}}」这一段的旁白加速到 1.5 倍仍比画面长 {{place_voice.trimmed}} 秒,超出的部分已裁掉。想保住整句,把这一段的旁白改短,或把这一段的素材取长一点再运行一次。"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "duck_source",
                "type": "edit_timeline",
                "name": "Duck the footage's own sound under the narration",
                "position": {
                  "x": 1680,
                  "y": 300
                },
                "config": {
                  "sequence_id": "{{input.sequence_id}}",
                  "operations": "[{\"kind\": \"set_clip_gain\", \"clip_id\": \"{{place_shot.clip_id}}\", \"gain\": 0.2, \"muted\": false}]"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "caption_shot",
                "type": "generate_subtitles",
                "name": "Lay this segment's captions",
                "position": {
                  "x": 400,
                  "y": 60
                },
                "config": {
                  "sequence_id": "{{input.sequence_id}}",
                  "segments": "{{loop.item.captions}}",
                  "offset": "",
                  "until": "",
                  "allow_empty": "yes"
                },
                "inputs": [
                  "offset",
                  "until"
                ]
              }
            ],
            "edges": [
              {
                "id": "caption_voice",
                "source": "caption_shot",
                "target": "has_voice"
              },
              {
                "id": "voice_narration",
                "source": "has_voice",
                "target": "has_narration",
                "source_handle": "true"
              },
              {
                "id": "narration_speak",
                "source": "has_narration",
                "target": "narrate",
                "source_handle": "true"
              },
              {
                "id": "narration_place",
                "source": "has_narration",
                "target": "place_voice",
                "source_handle": "true"
              },
              {
                "id": "place_duck",
                "source": "place_voice",
                "target": "duck_source"
              },
              {
                "id": "overflow_notify",
                "source": "voice_overflow",
                "target": "overflow_notice",
                "source_handle": "true"
              },
              {
                "id": "d-narrate-asset_id-place_voice-asset_id",
                "source": "narrate",
                "target": "place_voice",
                "kind": "data",
                "source_output": "asset_id",
                "target_input": "asset_id"
              },
              {
                "id": "d-place_shot-timeline_start-place_voice-at",
                "source": "place_shot",
                "target": "place_voice",
                "kind": "data",
                "source_output": "timeline_start",
                "target_input": "at"
              },
              {
                "id": "d-place_shot-duration-place_voice-max_duration",
                "source": "place_shot",
                "target": "place_voice",
                "kind": "data",
                "source_output": "duration",
                "target_input": "max_duration"
              },
              {
                "id": "d-place_voice-trimmed-voice_overflow-left",
                "source": "place_voice",
                "target": "voice_overflow",
                "kind": "data",
                "source_output": "trimmed",
                "target_input": "left"
              },
              {
                "id": "d-place_shot-timeline_start-caption_shot-offset",
                "source": "place_shot",
                "target": "caption_shot",
                "kind": "data",
                "source_output": "timeline_start",
                "target_input": "offset"
              },
              {
                "id": "d-place_shot-timeline_end-caption_shot-until",
                "source": "place_shot",
                "target": "caption_shot",
                "kind": "data",
                "source_output": "timeline_end",
                "target_input": "until"
              }
            ]
          },
          "concurrency": 1,
          "output": "{{place_shot.clip_id}}"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "export_montage",
        "type": "export_sequence",
        "name": "Export the montage",
        "position": {
          "x": 1930,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "sequence_id": ""
        },
        "inputs": [
          "sequence_id"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "done_notice",
        "type": "notify",
        "name": "Montage ready",
        "position": {
          "x": 2250,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "title": "混剪成片已导出",
          "body": "{{start.topic}} 已用 {{lay_segments.count}} 段素材完成混剪。"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "output",
        "type": "output",
        "name": "Hand over the cut and the plan",
        "position": {
          "x": 2570,
          "y": 260
        },
        "config": {
          "values": {
            "final_asset_id": "{{export_montage.asset_id}}",
            "sequence_id": "{{montage_project.sequence_id}}",
            "plan": "{{montage_plan.json}}",
            "storyline": "{{montage_plan.json.storyline}}",
            "unused_note": "{{montage_plan.json.unused_note}}",
            "segment_clip_ids": "{{lay_segments.results}}",
            "footage_count": "{{footage.count}}"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "id": "start_footage",
        "source": "start",
        "target": "footage"
      },
      {
        "id": "no_footage",
        "source": "has_footage",
        "target": "no_footage_notice",
        "source_handle": "false"
      },
      {
        "id": "footage_plan",
        "source": "has_footage",
        "target": "montage_plan",
        "source_handle": "true"
      },
      {
        "id": "footage_project",
        "source": "has_footage",
        "target": "montage_project",
        "source_handle": "true"
      },
      {
        "id": "plan_lay",
        "source": "montage_plan",
        "target": "lay_segments"
      },
      {
        "id": "project_lay",
        "source": "montage_project",
        "target": "lay_segments"
      },
      {
        "id": "lay_export",
        "source": "lay_segments",
        "target": "export_montage"
      },
      {
        "id": "export_notice",
        "source": "export_montage",
        "target": "done_notice"
      },
      {
        "id": "notice_output",
        "source": "done_notice",
        "target": "output"
      },
      {
        "id": "d-footage-count-has_footage-left",
        "source": "footage",
        "target": "has_footage",
        "kind": "data",
        "source_output": "count",
        "target_input": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "d-montage_project-sequence_id-export_montage-sequence_id",
        "source": "montage_project",
        "target": "export_montage",
        "kind": "data",
        "source_output": "sequence_id",
        "target_input": "sequence_id"
      }
    ]
  }
}
